# AegisVPN tor — SOCKS only inside the tunnel.
# Deployed behind the exit node; clients reach 10.8.<subnet>.1:9050 in-tunnel.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
# Isolate circuits per destination + per client credential (leak-safe)
SocksPolicy accept 10.8.0.0/16
SocksPolicy reject *
# Do not act as a public relay
ORPort 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
# Client hardening
ClientOnly 1
SafeLogging 1
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log
